        },
        "q_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer free shipping?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, on orders over $100 of small bathroom items like tapware, shower heads and sets, towel rails and accessories, anywhere in Australia. Under $100 it's a $20 flat rate. Basins, mirrors and sinks ship by Australia Post at a weight-based rate shown at checkout. Toilets, baths, vanities, shower screens and tiles are Perth metro delivery or pickup only; outside Perth, contact us for a freight quote.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you deliver?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, within Australia. Delivery options for your address are shown at checkout. If you can't see one, contact us for a delivery quote. We don't ship internationally. See <a href=\"/pages/delivery-pickup\">Delivery &amp; Pickup</a> and our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you deliver tiles outside Perth?",
            "answer": "<p>Tiles are delivered within the Perth metro area only, or you can pick them up from our Maddington showroom. Small bathroom items like tapware and accessories ship Australia-wide, free on orders over $100.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_3": {
